    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84367" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make of a certain quality,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ποιοῦν αὐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					2.1.5
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be endowed with quality,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Stoic.
				2.220
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.108
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα τοιόνδε οἷον ποιωθὲν ψυχῆς
					εἰδώλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					1.1.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.3.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πεποιωμένον τῷ οἴνῳ γάλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.95
				</span></i>
			.</div>
